# #927: the whole runtime storage tree. Only `results/` was ignored, under
# the path result.routes.js used before #893 -- src/storage/, which resolved
# one level deeper than every other storage writer because that file sits in
# src/interface/routes/ rather than src/controllers/. #893 unified it onto
# STORAGE_BASE, which moved it OUT of this ignore and into api/backend/
# storage/, so the ignore has to follow. The three siblings were never
# ignored at all.
#
# Already-tracked files are unaffected by a gitignore rule, which is why
# api/backend/storage/samples/<id>/files/ still versioned a committed
# personal PDF after this rule landed. #961 (Axis E E4) untracked it with
# git rm --cached; per that decision it was NOT removed from history.
api/backend/src/storage/
api/backend/storage/

